ly, thoroughly, by all means (with न, ‘by no means, not at all’), Mn.; MBh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "correctly, truly, properly, fitly, in the right way or manner, well, duly (with √ कृ, ‘to make good [a promise]’), Up.; Mn.; MBh. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "distinctly, clearly, MW.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "सम्यक् in comp. for सम्यञ्च्.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "samyakarmanta": [{"id": "samyakkarmAnta", "headword": "सम्यक्कर्मान्त", "headword_slp1": "samyakkarmAnta", "fold": "samyakarmanta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "सम्यक्—कर्मान्त m. (with Buddhists) right action or occupation (one division of the आर्याष्टाङ्ग-मार्ग, ‘holy eightfold path’; the other 7 are given below), Lalit.; Dharmas. 50; MWB. 44 &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "samyakarin": [{"id": "samyakkArin", "headword": "सम्यक्कारिन्", "headword_slp1": "samyakkArin", "fold": "samyakarin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "सम्यक्—कारिन् See अ-स्˚.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "samyakcaritra": [{"id": "samyakcAritra", "headword": "सम्यक्चारित्र", "headword_slp1": "samyakcAritra", "fold": "samyakcaritra", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "सम्यक्—चारित्र n. (with Jainas) r˚ conduct (see रत्न-त्रय).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "samyakta": [{"id": "samyaktA", "headword": "सम्यक्ता", "headword_slp1": "samyaktA", "fold": "samyakta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "सम्यक्—ता f. rightness, correct manner, Prab., Sch.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "samyaktva": [{"id": "samyaktva", "headword": "सम्यक्त्व", "headword_slp1": "samyaktva", "fold": "samyaktva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "सम्यक्—त्व n. id., MBh.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "completeness, perfection, Śatr. (क्षायिक-स्˚, ‘that perfection in which material existence is destroyed’, W.)", "glo